{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01957","headline":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 长垂双玉嗁 · 赵嘏","name":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 长垂双玉嗁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"双双红泪堕，度日暗中嗁。\n鴈出居延北，人犹辽海西。\n向灯垂玉枕，对月洒金闺。\n不惜罗衣湿，惟愁归意迷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01957.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01957","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}